{"url": "https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo%3Awithastro/astro%20type%3Apr%20created%3A2025-08-23..2026-08-23&per_page=1", "ts": "2026-11-20T15:11:23.423451+00:00", "body": {"total_count": 2470, "incomplete_results": false, "items": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17802", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17802/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17802/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17802/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17802", "id": 5226637365, "node_id": "PR_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABAsu12Q", "number": 17802, "title": "fix(routing): drop request body for GET/HEAD during rewrites", "user": {"login": "haoku123", "id": 136181678, "node_id": "U_kgDOCB33rg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136181678?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123", "html_url": "https://github.com/haoku123", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/haoku123/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 3559105225, "node_id": "LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro", "name": "pkg: astro", "color": "b4a8d1", "default": false, "description": "Related to the core `astro` package (scope)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2026-08-23T11:22:48Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-25T20:29:25Z", "closed_at": "2026-08-25T20:29:25Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17802", "html_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17802", "diff_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17802.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17802.patch", "merged_at": null}, "body": "## Problem\n\nFixes #17801\n\nWhen a GET or HEAD request carries a body, `copyRequest()` in `packages/astro/src/core/routing/rewrite.ts` forwards the body unconditionally. Constructing the new `Request` then throws a `TypeError` per the Fetch spec:\n\n```\nTypeError: Request with a GET or HEAD method cannot have a body.\n    at createRequest (\u2026)\n    at copyRequest (\u2026)\n    at applyRewriteToState (\u2026)\n```\n\nA rewrite of a GET request that happens to carry a body therefore fails with an opaque 500.\n\n## Solution\n\nSkip the body when the method is `GET` or `HEAD`, since those methods must not carry a payload (https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-fetch). Methods that support a body (`POST`, `PUT`, `PATCH`, ...) are unaffected.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `packages/astro/src/core/routing/rewrite.ts`: only forward `oldRequest.body` for non-GET/HEAD methods.\n- `packages/astro/test/units/routing/rewrite.test.ts`: added `copyRequest` tests covering GET (body dropped), HEAD (body dropped), and POST (body preserved).", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17802/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17802/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}], "search_type": "lexical"}}